  + serde_json Value object construction retained only one value for duplicate object keys, so a duplicated top-level field or nested environment key was not independently refused
  + typed deserialization also accepted semantically equivalent JSON with whitespace or alternate presentation even though retained evidence requires one exact compact machine form

& [Risk]
  + duplicate-key collapse permits producer and verifier interpretations to diverge before detached authorization is evaluated
  + noncanonical byte acceptance weakens the exact-byte relation among authorization payload request envelope and retained evidence

& [Correction]
  + a recursive no-duplicate visitor now traverses every array and object before Value shape validation and typed parsing
  + every bounded typed machine form is reserialized and required to equal the supplied bytes exactly
  + outer evidence bundle parsing independently enforces its 4194304-byte bound and exact compact serialization
  + adversarial assertions cover duplicated top-level profile duplicated nested environment key whitespace and pretty evidence

